{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the middle of the night to the sound of gunfire on the neighboring farm. Worried, you decide to investigate and discover your nightmare has come true. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Arise is a tribute to zombie FPS games, a retro experience from the 1990s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the landscapes, taking down zombies and collecting resources, follow the radio call, and escape this hell called the zombie apocalypse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, with the first campaign available. New episodes will be developed and published.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908660/extras/d91a925cf19018c33211cd3359813c41.avif?t=1756437178\" width=1600 height=441 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zombie Arise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908660/1899feab0710582b0aa846b86a5297d31f713f56.jpg"},{"name":"Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908660/1899feab0710582b0aa846b86a5297d31f713f56.jpg"},{"name":"It stinks like death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908660/1899feab0710582b0aa846b86a5297d31f713f56.jpg"},{"name":"A way out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908660/1899feab0710582b0aa846b86a5297d31f713f56.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908660?t=1756437178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908660?t=1756437178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908660/eb8c0073566797aac68be81d31420fbbec7d5ed4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756437178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st